ules, grid weights, exact product versions and preprocessing code are not supplied, so upstream NASA extraction and the claimed 1,384-cell spatial audit cannot be independently verified from this package.","Supplied statistical CSVs remain authoritative, with fixed 2000–2025 coverage. Chart-window changes do not recompute these tests.","Zero p-values are retained as reported numerical precision, not interpreted as proof of zero probability."]}